---
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";

const clikkinUrl = "https://clikkin.com";
---

<Section
  id="clikkin"
  eyebrow="Powered by"
  title="The Startup Club lives on Clikkin."
  intro="Clikkin is a privacy-first platform for distributed communities. The Startup Club's space — where founders, investors, and operators actually talk to each other — runs there. Scan the QR to join the space."
>
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.05fr] gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--color-line)] bg-[color:var(--color-bg-elev)] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <img
        src="/images/clikkin-qr.svg"
        alt="QR code to join The Startup Club space on Clikkin"
        width="280"
        height="280"
        class="w-full max-w-[280px] h-auto"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <p class="mt-5 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-soft)]">
        Open your camera. Point. Tap the link.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Why Clikkin</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[15.5px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        We wanted a home for the community that wasn't a Slack workspace fighting for attention with everyone else's, wasn't a Telegram group lost to noise, and wasn't a feed someone else owns. Clikkin lets us run a dedicated space with the operating model we want — clear roles, real privacy, posts that surface by quality not by algorithm.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[15.5px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        Scanning the QR drops you into The Startup Club space on Clikkin. You'll see the active threads, the people in the room, and the way the conversation is organised.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-soft)]">
        Curious how Clikkin works?
        <a href={clikkinUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold">Learn more at clikkin.com →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
